 class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battle never stops.<br>In the midst of randomly appearing cards every moment, choose the skill you need most right now.<br>Resources are limited, and opportunities are fleeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Synergy in Card Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/de3e221952e3f8e458db5069dc2dbb71.poster.avif?t=1752123058\" aria-label=\"change your strategy\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/de3e221952e3f8e458db5069dc2dbb71.webm?t=1752123058\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828280/extras/de3e221952e3f8e458db5069dc2dbb71.mp4?t=1752123058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winning is not just about having the strongest cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must quickly judge and combine cards to create powerful chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Decisions Are the Art of Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instant judgment, perfected decks.<br>Your choices and your deck are the key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time card selection and tactical action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressure of limited resources and spontaneous choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy design based on synergy between cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique near-future + martial arts world setting and atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["GoldKids"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"descrip